        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p><em>Dark Hollow Flash: Ash.</em> A black cero fired point-blank down a corridor of nothing.</p><p><strong>120-foot line</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>spirit</strong> damage.</p><p>A creature reduced to 0 Hit Points by this <strong>crumbles to ash</strong>; returning it to life requires a 10th-rank effect.</p><hr /><p><strong>&#9888; Extrapolated name</strong> &mdash; the ash is canon: it is how Ulquiorra himself ends.</p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
